// Package validate is the runtime that code generated by kanna-validate calls.
//
// A generated Validate method checks each field with plain Go and collects what
// broke into Errors: every broken rule rather than the first, each under the
// path that the JSON names spell. The codes and params follow Rails'
// ActiveModel::Validations (blank, too_long with a count, ...), and Errors
// encodes as Rails encodes errors.details.
//
// This package is one of the few kanna publishes: the generated code imports
// it, and so does the code that inspects what Validate returned.
package validate
